1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:02,120
Well, if you're not

2
00:00:02,130 --> 00:00:04,830
going to give me money,
then why are you calling?

3
00:00:04,830 --> 00:00:06,930
She wants to talk to you.

4
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:10,100
Who's crazy now?

5
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:13,270
(Leonard:)Hello, Mrs. Latham.

6
00:00:13,270 --> 00:00:16,170
(Leonard:)Yes, I live with him.

7
00:00:16,170 --> 00:00:18,670
(Sheldon:)I don't...
I-I really don't know why.

8
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:27,710
(Leonard:)Tonight? Sure,
that'd be great.

9
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:30,120
Okay, I'll see you then.

10
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:31,490
(Leonard:)Bye.

11
00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:34,620
(Leonard:)She wants to have dinner
and talk about my research.

12
00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:38,090
(Sheldon:)An entire dinner
to talk about your research?

13
00:00:39,430 --> 00:00:42,500
(Sheldon:)Where you going, the drive-thru
at Jack in the Box?

14
00:00:44,830 --> 00:00:47,100
(Leonard:)Well, wherever
we're going,

15
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:50,240
(Leonard:)she's sending a car
to pick me up.

16
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:51,570
(Raj:)Okay,

17
00:00:51,570 --> 00:00:53,670
(Sheldon:)- I see what's happening.
- What?

18
00:00:53,670 --> 00:00:55,840
(Sheldon:)My stature intimidates her,

19
00:00:55,840 --> 00:01:00,020
(Sheldon:)so she's using you to get to me.

